sequenceDiagram
    autonumber

    participant APP as activity_node
    participant BENCH as Benchmark harness
    participant DMA as GPDMA1
    participant DWT as Cortex-M33 DWT
    participant AI as ST Edge AI
    participant SRAM as Activation SRAM
    participant TEL as Telemetry runtime
    participant HOST as Host / laxity-tui

    BENCH->>DMA: Configure aggressor region and working set
    BENCH->>DMA: Start circular memory traffic

    APP->>DWT: Read start cycle
    APP->>AI: Run inference with selected arena

    par CPU inference
        AI->>SRAM: Activation and tensor accesses
    and Independent DMA traffic
        DMA->>SRAM: Memory-to-memory transfers
    end

    AI-->>APP: Inference complete
    APP->>DWT: Read end cycle
    DWT-->>APP: Execution interval

    APP->>TEL: Push inference record
    Note over APP,TEL: Timing interval has already ended

    TEL-->>HOST: Framed telemetry
    HOST->>HOST: Validate sequence and CRC
    HOST->>HOST: Update live experiment state
    HOST->>HOST: Render latency and placement
